  "instructions": [
    "heat olive oil in a mini cocotte over medium-high heat.",
    "add minced garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "add chicken breast and cook until browned, then remove from heat.",
    "add hoisin sauce, smoked paprika, ground cumin, salt, and red chili flakes to the cocotte and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add uncooked rice, chicken broth, and browned chicken to the cocotte, then stir to combine.",
    "bring the mixture to a boil, reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes or until the rice is cooked and the chicken is cooked through.",
    "stir in lemon juice and chopped fresh parsley before serving.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
